{"id":"stimmung","lemma":"Stimmung","pos":"noun","rank":1835,"glosses":["mood (emotional state)","mood (inclination to do something)","lively atmosphere; vibe; exuberance (good mood of a group or crowd, e.g. at a party)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/De-Stimmung.ogg/De-Stimmung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Stimmung","plural":"Stimmungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich war in einer guten Stimmung.","en":"I was in a good mood.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin nicht in der Stimmung.","en":"I'm not in the mood.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Sie ist in schlechter Stimmung.","en":"She is in a bad mood.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"worse"},null]},{"text":"Musik hebt die Stimmung.","en":"Music lifts the spirits.","words":[{"g":"music"},{"g":"to lift","l":"heben"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Du verdirbst die Stimmung.","en":"You're spoiling the mood.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to deprive of","l":"verderben"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}